+      reuse/all findings=1 sessions=1 verdicts=0/0/0/1 confirmed_pct=null outcomes=1/0/0 acted_pct=100
+      reuse/medium findings=1 sessions=1 verdicts=0/0/0/1 confirmed_pct=null outcomes=1/0/0 acted_pct=100"
